# Research and Desire — Community Mods License and Copyright Notices

This repository hosts **community-contributed** modifications for Research and
Desire products (Lockbox, Deep Throat Trainer, OSSM, RADR). Each mod is
copyright its respective author.

Contributions are accepted **only** under the unified RAD license model — the
same licenses as the products they modify. There is no contributor license
choice; by submitting, you agree your contribution is licensed as below
(see `CONTRIBUTING.md` and the required DCO sign-off).

## Path map

1. Hardware / printable design files — `mods/**/cad/`, `mods/**/print/`
   (STEP, STL, 3MF, F3D, etc.) → **CERN-OHL-S v2**.
   Full text: [`LICENSES/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.txt`](LICENSES/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.txt).
2. Software / firmware — any code shipped inside a mod
   (`mods/**/src/`, scripts, sketches) → **MPL 2.0**.
   Full text: [`LICENSES/MPL-2.0.txt`](LICENSES/MPL-2.0.txt).
3. Documentation and images within a mod (`README.md`, `mods/**/img/`,
   `mods/**/docs/`) → **CERN-OHL-S v2** (travels with the hardware it documents).
4. Repository tooling — `.github/`, `schemas`, lint/gallery scripts → **MPL 2.0**.
5. Research and Desire / product branding and trademarks
   (`Research and Desire`, `Lockbox`, `Chastity Lockbox`, `Deep Throat Trainer`,
   `DT Trainer`, `OSSM`, `RADR`) → all rights reserved; remove from derivatives.

## Not warranted by RAD

Mods in this repository are **community-maintained**. They are **not** official
Research and Desire products and have **not** been safety-tested or certified by
RAD. Use at your own risk. See `CONTRIBUTING.md` for the safety-review policy.
